# math/native - pure Aiki math functions using Taylor series

@func sin
@template "sin(x, terms)"
@help "Returns sine of x using Taylor series with given terms."

@func cos
@template "cos(x, terms)"
@help "Returns cosine of x using Taylor series with given terms."

@func sqrt
@template "sqrt(x, iterations)"
@help "Returns square root using Newton's method with given iterations."
